@MediPro.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5020

### Health
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (dev seed admin — see appsettings.Development.json)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@medipro.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe!12345"
}

### Register medical store (pending approval)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register-store
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "store@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe!12345",
  "businessName": "Test Pharmacy",
  "addressLine": "Street 1",
  "city": "Rawalpindi",
  "mobile": "03001234567",
  "contactName": "Owner",
  "licenseNumber": null
}

### List stores (admin — paste Bearer token)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve store (replace store id)
PATCH {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/stores/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approval
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved",
  "notes": "Verified"
}

### List products (Bearer — admin sees inactive too)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List products — with filters (optional query params)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20&manufacturer=Demo%20Labs&category=Tablet&salt=Demo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter dropdown values (manufacturers + categories)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/filters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one product by id (store or admin Bearer)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create product (admin)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "DEMO-001",
  "name": "Demo product",
  "pack": "10's",
  "manufacturer": "Demo Labs",
  "saltComposition": "Demo salt",
  "category": "Tablet",
  "tradePrice": 100.00,
  "mrp": 120.00,
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

### Admin — seed demo catalogue (TEST-MED-* SKUs, dev or AllowDemoCatalogEndpoint)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/catalog/seed-demo-catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin — seed demo pharmacy accounts (*@demo.medipro.local, dev or AllowDemoCatalogEndpoint)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/stores/seed-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin — low stock (active SKUs with stock ≤ threshold, default 20)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/catalog/low-stock?threshold=20&max=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin — adjust stock by SKU (add 25 units; use negative delta to reduce)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/catalog/stock-adjustment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "DEMO-001",
  "delta": 25
}

### Cart — get (approved store user token)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{store_token}}

### Cart — add line (replace product id)
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{store_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Orders — submit from cart
POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{store_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": null
}

### Orders — list (admin or store)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Orders — update status (admin)
PATCH {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed",
  "statusNotes": null
}

### Catalog — import template (no Bearer required)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/catalog/import-template

### Admin notifications (Bearer admin)
GET {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20&unreadOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark notification read (replace id)
PATCH {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product import — use REST Client multipart form: field name "file", .xlsx body (admin token)
# POST {{MediPro.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/catalog/import
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----abc
# (attach file in your REST client UI)
